    "title": "About the EX FireRed & LeafGreen set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: EX FireRed & LeafGreen is a EX expansion released on 1 September 2004. It has 116 cards: 112 in the main set and 4 secret rares. There are also 103 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 112 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (215 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 219 cards, adding the 4 secret rares).",
